labelled: 2026-09-24
--- code
export function newBookNarrowing(currency: string): BookNarrowing {
  return {
    keepsBook: book =>
      !isPostingBook(book) || hasPostingDeclaring(book, currency),

    keepsPosting: (posting, book) =>
      !isPostingBook(book) || declaresCurrency({ book, posting }, currency),
  };
}
--- facts
How a ledger treats an empty book is unknown.
`keepsBook` returns false for a posting book where no posting declares the currency.

# claimed at this site by an earlier run:
A ledger's handling of an empty book is unknown, so the narrowing drops the whole book.
